WEBVTT

00:12.512 --> 00:14.055
You guys are slow!

00:14.139 --> 00:16.558
Still too slow! Give it your all!

00:16.641 --> 00:18.393
The sun will set soon!

00:20.520 --> 00:23.481
Swing your arms more
and put your feet forward!

00:24.107 --> 00:25.108
Okay!

00:31.573 --> 00:33.533
Raise your voice more!

00:34.451 --> 00:37.912
To you who is ignorant of
What eternity means

00:37.996 --> 00:41.207
It's time to show you the answer

00:41.291 --> 00:47.589
Beyond the endless spiral

00:56.181 --> 01:01.019
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA:
HASHIRA TRAINING ARC

01:03.396 --> 01:06.816
The reason why it sounded like an excuse

01:06.900 --> 01:10.361
A weakness that draws in a fleeting future

01:10.445 --> 01:15.575
You mistake it for strength

01:16.951 --> 01:18.787
So detestable, so detestable

01:18.870 --> 01:20.538
So disgraceful, so disgraceful

01:20.622 --> 01:23.917
The heart that is so bleak

01:24.000 --> 01:25.794
So dark, so dark

01:25.877 --> 01:27.754
That it almost hides the moon

01:27.837 --> 01:31.341
If only you weren't here

01:31.424 --> 01:34.928
It sways and sways

01:35.011 --> 01:38.556
Carrying on its intentions
Just like a flower

01:38.640 --> 01:41.935
Taking it all away, taking it all away

01:42.018 --> 01:45.438
It tears the heart just like a storm would

01:45.522 --> 01:49.025
To you who is ignorant of
What eternity means

01:49.109 --> 01:52.570
It's time to show you the answer

01:52.654 --> 01:57.951
Beyond the endless spiral

01:58.034 --> 02:02.163
Who awaits there

02:05.208 --> 02:09.963
EPISODE 3: TANJIRO IS FULLY RECOVERED
AND TAKING THE HASHIRA TRAINING!

02:10.046 --> 02:12.298
One! Two!

02:12.382 --> 02:14.425
Without improving your basic fitness,

02:14.509 --> 02:16.803
you won't be able
to move on to the next stage!

02:16.886 --> 02:19.305
Perfect the basics! The fundamentals!

02:23.977 --> 02:25.311
If you're this weak,

02:25.395 --> 02:30.984
there's no way you'll be able to handle
Shinazugawa and Kanroji's training.

02:31.067 --> 02:32.318
How sloppy.

02:33.069 --> 02:35.321
Forgive me!

02:35.405 --> 02:36.990
Hell.

02:37.073 --> 02:39.242
This is hell.

02:39.325 --> 02:41.828
Even if we get out of here,
another hell is waiting.

02:41.911 --> 02:43.872
Stand up! Get yourselves together!

02:43.955 --> 02:44.998
Geez!

02:45.081 --> 02:47.417
Uzui!

02:47.500 --> 02:50.587
Well, if it isn't Kamado!

02:50.670 --> 02:52.422
Long time no see!

02:53.673 --> 02:54.674
Likewise.

02:55.258 --> 02:56.718
It's been a while.

02:56.801 --> 02:59.345
I'm glad to see you doing well.

03:00.513 --> 03:03.349
Even if you say so, look at my state now.

03:06.102 --> 03:09.188
I heard you fought against
the Upper Ranks again.

03:09.272 --> 03:12.191
Lucky you, your body
is still completely intact.

03:12.275 --> 03:15.445
Thanks to everyone, I managed to survive.

03:15.528 --> 03:16.529
Great.

03:16.613 --> 03:20.491
And here, it's time to wake up
that sluggish body of yours!

03:20.575 --> 03:22.493
Yes! I'll do my best!

03:48.394 --> 03:49.687
Oh, my!

03:49.771 --> 03:51.231
Heya!

03:51.314 --> 03:52.523
Tanjiro!

03:52.607 --> 03:54.067
Finally, you came.

03:54.150 --> 03:56.152
How have you been, everyone?

03:56.903 --> 03:58.863
Thank you for the last mission.

03:58.947 --> 04:01.241
No need to be so formal.

04:01.324 --> 04:03.409
We're the ones who are grateful.

04:03.493 --> 04:05.328
Your face looks better.

04:05.411 --> 04:07.455
Yup! You've got the face of a man.

04:08.581 --> 04:10.625
You guys need to eat more!

04:11.876 --> 04:15.797
If you don't eat, the afternoon training
will be even harder!

04:15.880 --> 04:20.468
I'll increase the amount of training
for whoever wastes food.

04:20.551 --> 04:22.011
We'll finish the food!

04:23.513 --> 04:24.764
Please give me some too.

04:24.847 --> 04:25.890
Here you go!

04:25.974 --> 04:27.558
Eat a lot, okay?

04:27.642 --> 04:29.435
Thank you. I'll eat!

04:30.603 --> 04:35.024
If you don't finish this soup,
Sir Tengen will give you extra training!

04:38.319 --> 04:41.072
You have a night patrol duty
tonight, right?

04:41.155 --> 04:42.198
Yeah.

04:42.282 --> 04:43.574
Wanna switch with me?

04:43.658 --> 04:46.828
No way. If you have night patrol duty,

04:46.911 --> 04:49.998
you're allowed to not attend training
in the morning.

04:57.171 --> 04:58.256
Geez!

05:08.808 --> 05:11.686
The demons really
haven't been appearing lately.

05:12.729 --> 05:15.356
Even so, the nights
are still kind of scary.

05:16.065 --> 05:20.194
I heard the demons
are searching for that Nezuko girl.

05:21.362 --> 05:23.156
It's just speculation.

05:24.699 --> 05:27.535
Because nobody
has asked those demons directly.

05:28.453 --> 05:30.538
Well, that's true, but…

05:30.621 --> 05:34.792
I hope they just stay away
and disappear like this.

05:34.876 --> 05:37.045
It won't be that easy.

05:37.128 --> 05:41.007
The demon slaying has been continuing
for a thousand years.

05:45.303 --> 05:47.597
Hey, where are you?

06:00.651 --> 06:04.155
They might appear
in the back alleys like this.

06:04.238 --> 06:06.240
Don't screw around!

06:06.324 --> 06:07.700
Sorry, sorry.

06:16.375 --> 06:20.213
Don't do that again.
Let's patrol properly.

06:20.296 --> 06:21.380
Yeah.

06:32.934 --> 06:34.477
FOUR

06:43.569 --> 06:46.322
All right! Let's do the next training!

06:46.405 --> 06:47.782
Pair up, a team of two!

06:49.325 --> 06:50.451
Let's go!

06:52.703 --> 06:54.163
So fast!

06:56.415 --> 06:59.710
Come on! Show me what you've got!

07:11.472 --> 07:15.977
Do we need to have that much stamina
to fight the Upper Rank demons?

07:21.399 --> 07:24.152
The Upper Ranks
must be really strong, huh?

07:24.861 --> 07:26.863
Yeah, they're unbelievably strong.

07:27.530 --> 07:28.781
How was it?

07:29.866 --> 07:31.659
Let me think.

07:31.742 --> 07:34.871
Before I knew it, whump!
I was already on the ground.

07:34.954 --> 07:38.791
I wasn't dead yet and I could react,
but when I stood up again…

07:38.875 --> 07:41.085
And bam! I got attacked again.

07:41.169 --> 07:42.962
Then, it's like, bwooosh!

07:43.504 --> 07:45.548
When my brains didn't get any oxygen--

07:45.631 --> 07:47.633
I know, I know, enough.

07:48.342 --> 07:52.263
There are worlds that we ordinary people
just can't understand.

07:56.601 --> 07:58.853
All right! The last training for today!

07:59.520 --> 08:00.938
Let's see…

08:02.106 --> 08:03.691
Today, it will be that mountain!

08:03.774 --> 08:05.860
Run around that mountain once
and come back!

08:05.943 --> 08:06.861
What?

08:06.944 --> 08:09.447
Keep dawdling
and you won't get any dinner!

08:11.491 --> 08:13.743
Come on! Run! Get up quickly!

08:14.452 --> 08:17.413
Getting tired just from this
won't make you better!

08:19.665 --> 08:22.877
Sir Tengen seems cruel on the outside.

08:22.960 --> 08:25.922
But he's actually gentle on the inside.

08:26.005 --> 08:31.177
The other day, he didn't even eat
until the last member returned.

08:31.260 --> 08:34.472
In the end, he went all the way
to the mountain to pick him up.

08:36.682 --> 08:38.518
I can hear it all, you know?

08:40.436 --> 08:45.441
No way I'd crush the Corps members
entrusted to me by the Master.

08:46.150 --> 08:47.360
Right, right.

08:48.694 --> 08:50.238
Well, then, I'm going too.

08:50.321 --> 08:52.323
Good. Go and come back pronto.

08:58.079 --> 09:02.833
Those who became Hashiras
are actually kind-hearted deep down.

09:06.337 --> 09:09.090
Mister, give me one more!

09:09.173 --> 09:10.341
All right!

09:11.092 --> 09:12.677
I'm almost at my limit.

09:13.678 --> 09:15.096
But if I don't win this,

09:15.846 --> 09:18.349
I can't keep my promise to the Master.

09:20.726 --> 09:23.771
In order to make Giyu cooperate
with everyone,

09:23.854 --> 09:25.481
I have to do my best.

09:27.525 --> 09:28.526
I order one more.

09:29.443 --> 09:30.570
All right!

09:31.904 --> 09:36.534
You said I have to participate
in the training if I lose.

09:36.617 --> 09:39.370
Does that mean, if I win,
I don't have to participate?

09:41.414 --> 09:43.249
Well…

09:43.332 --> 09:44.875
Here you go.

09:44.959 --> 09:46.168
You too.

09:47.169 --> 09:49.839
Mister, give him one more.

09:49.922 --> 09:51.007
All right!

09:53.175 --> 09:55.761
This is my last portion.

09:57.013 --> 10:02.059
In other words, if you can finish
the next portion, you'll win.

10:03.477 --> 10:06.397
With that, I will participate
in the Hashira Training,

10:06.480 --> 10:08.232
and you'll be satisfied, right?

10:09.025 --> 10:10.610
Yes! Glad to hear that!

10:11.652 --> 10:13.279
Then finish your portions.

10:13.988 --> 10:15.031
I will!

10:16.365 --> 10:19.994
Giyu should be able to eat more, but…

10:22.288 --> 10:25.916
Even so, this is tough.

10:26.000 --> 10:27.710
Really tough!

10:45.728 --> 10:47.063
I'm late.

10:48.314 --> 10:50.650
I also arrived just a moment ago.

10:50.733 --> 10:53.194
So, how's your training with the members?

10:54.320 --> 10:59.075
I don't think they will be useful
when fighting against the Upper Ranks.

11:01.952 --> 11:03.913
Same here.

11:04.914 --> 11:08.751
Still, nurturing the Corps members
is the Master's will.

11:09.752 --> 11:10.878
Yeah.

11:11.837 --> 11:14.173
Why did you call me at this hour?

11:16.634 --> 11:19.053
I've been wondering.

11:20.805 --> 11:22.640
That matter in the castle?

11:26.227 --> 11:29.063
We believed that we cornered those demons.

11:29.146 --> 11:33.192
However, all of them managed
to disappear somewhere.

11:37.154 --> 11:41.909
All those demons,
gone in an instant without a trace.

11:42.785 --> 11:43.869
Yeah.

11:44.662 --> 11:46.997
I've been thinking about it ever since.

11:47.748 --> 11:50.042
What lies beyond that door?

11:51.210 --> 11:55.798
Is it the demons' hideout
that we don't know about?

11:56.841 --> 11:58.217
Hideout, huh?

11:59.093 --> 12:01.846
I've investigated that castle
several times,

12:01.929 --> 12:03.764
but I couldn't find anything.

12:05.182 --> 12:10.229
Right around that time, the demons
in the city suddenly disappeared.

12:10.312 --> 12:13.357
So it's true their target
is Kamado's sister.

12:14.942 --> 12:16.694
There's no doubt.

12:17.611 --> 12:20.656
Something big might be about to start.

12:23.576 --> 12:27.746
No matter what it is, I'll end it all.

12:29.790 --> 12:34.503
For the Demon Slayer Corps,
perhaps this is an omen of misfortune.

12:37.256 --> 12:40.843
Training the slayers
keeps my mind distracted.

12:42.136 --> 12:44.597
When I calmly read the situation,

12:45.347 --> 12:48.476
I can't help but be conscious
of what lies ahead.

12:50.311 --> 12:51.937
This calm could be…

12:54.940 --> 12:57.610
the calm before the storm.

12:59.153 --> 13:01.655
It's pointless to say whatever it is.

13:03.199 --> 13:05.910
I have a suggestion for you.

13:07.995 --> 13:10.206
I have one as well.

13:10.831 --> 13:12.583
Let me say it first.

13:15.461 --> 13:17.087
Fight me!

13:18.255 --> 13:19.423
What a coincidence.

13:20.341 --> 13:22.510
I was about to say that too.

13:27.139 --> 13:28.641
I'll put it here.

13:28.724 --> 13:31.143
Thanks, Tanjiro.

13:31.894 --> 13:33.354
Drink it.

13:33.437 --> 13:35.564
It's high-grade Gyokuro green tea.

13:35.648 --> 13:37.399
Good for relieving fatigue.

13:37.483 --> 13:38.567
I see.

13:39.068 --> 13:40.277
Thank you very much.

13:44.031 --> 13:45.115
It's delicious.

13:45.824 --> 13:47.618
Tanjiro, we wanted to thank you again

13:47.701 --> 13:50.162
for saving us
at the Entertainment District.

13:50.246 --> 13:52.289
-Thank you.
-Huh?

13:52.373 --> 13:54.041
We're really grateful.

13:54.124 --> 13:57.586
Don't be. It wasn't my strength alone.

13:58.879 --> 14:03.592
You, your sister, the boar boy,
the yellow-head boy.

14:04.385 --> 14:05.719
And of course, Sir Tengen.

14:06.387 --> 14:10.849
If we were even one person short,
we wouldn't have seen the sun again.

14:12.518 --> 14:15.145
I didn't think Sir Tengen
and the three of us

14:15.229 --> 14:17.481
could have come back alive together.

14:18.315 --> 14:20.109
It was truly a miracle.

14:21.610 --> 14:22.945
Hinatsuru.

14:23.028 --> 14:26.991
I'm sure that Sir Tengen
actually still wants to fight.

14:28.367 --> 14:31.579
He often talks in his sleep
in the middle of the night.

14:32.371 --> 14:35.374
He's been blaming himself for withdrawing.

14:36.792 --> 14:40.504
Tanjiro, make sure you defeat
Muzan Kibutsuji.

14:42.298 --> 14:43.966
Yes, I will.

14:50.347 --> 14:52.808
Listen carefully, all of you!

14:52.892 --> 14:55.227
We're canceling
the usual long-distance run

14:55.311 --> 14:57.438
around the mountain for today.

14:58.105 --> 15:00.816
Instead, we'll have
a special training session

15:00.900 --> 15:01.942
based on real combat.

15:03.569 --> 15:05.529
Let's head into the mountain!

15:08.908 --> 15:11.201
We always fight demons at night.

15:12.369 --> 15:16.165
That's why we have to improve our skills
to fight in the dark.

15:17.207 --> 15:21.545
Strain your eyes in the darkness
and sense what you can't see.

15:22.588 --> 15:24.757
I'll be a demon from now on.

15:25.758 --> 15:27.760
A demon who will eat you.

15:29.136 --> 15:31.055
Try to survive against me.

15:32.598 --> 15:34.099
And you, Kamado.

15:34.183 --> 15:38.520
Your role is to defeat me
while protecting your comrades.

15:51.450 --> 15:53.702
Hey, he's coming! He's close!

16:07.424 --> 16:08.759
I can't see anything!

16:09.259 --> 16:11.762
I expect nothing less from Uzui,
a former ninja.

16:11.845 --> 16:13.764
I can't track his presence by scent.

16:14.890 --> 16:17.351
Where? Where's Uzui?

16:30.948 --> 16:32.032
Uzui!

16:32.700 --> 16:34.118
It… It's impossible.

16:35.160 --> 16:37.371
We can't fight a Hashira.

16:41.083 --> 16:43.794
Are you going to say that
when fighting a demon too?

16:49.341 --> 16:54.430
Uzui, a former Hashira, can see through
any half-baked movements completely!

16:54.513 --> 16:57.641
Gather! Stay close to me!

16:57.725 --> 17:00.561
Back-to-back,
and don't leave any openings!

17:02.271 --> 17:04.273
Slow! You guys are slow! So slow!

17:09.695 --> 17:11.905
Way to go, Kamado.

17:11.989 --> 17:14.491
This much strength even though one-handed.

17:14.575 --> 17:16.076
Uzui's really amazing.

17:18.871 --> 17:21.582
Come on! Strike me more!

17:21.665 --> 17:22.708
Okay!

17:27.129 --> 17:29.423
Incredible.

17:30.132 --> 17:33.427
He's going toe-to-toe
with a former Hashira!

17:38.265 --> 17:43.520
So this is the fighting between those who
have survived battles against Upper Ranks.

17:47.316 --> 17:50.694
You've gotten stronger, Kamado.

18:05.793 --> 18:06.960
Everyone!

18:11.256 --> 18:13.592
Finally, it's getting interesting!

18:14.510 --> 18:15.677
Come at me!

18:32.194 --> 18:35.739
You got beaten up by me,
one who has retired.

18:38.158 --> 18:40.577
Geez, not even pretending to be tough?

18:41.495 --> 18:42.996
We just can't.

18:43.580 --> 18:46.375
Fighting a former Hashira is too much.

18:47.334 --> 18:51.380
Hey, hey, I didn't train you guys
to scare you.

18:52.256 --> 18:53.423
I know!

18:54.424 --> 18:57.177
Now I have hope that Hashiras and Kamado

18:57.261 --> 19:00.556
can defeat Upper Ranks
or even Muzan Kibutsuji!

19:00.639 --> 19:01.682
Me too.

19:01.765 --> 19:03.517
-I agree!
-Same here!

19:03.600 --> 19:09.565
We'll do our best so that someday
we can support them, even a little!

19:09.648 --> 19:12.025
I'll train and become strong!

19:12.109 --> 19:13.819
We'll become strong!

19:14.653 --> 19:15.779
You guys…

19:29.668 --> 19:34.298
One! Two! One! Two! One! Two!

19:34.381 --> 19:38.051
They've been becoming tougher
in their own way.

19:39.178 --> 19:41.346
You have nothing left to do here.

19:41.430 --> 19:42.931
You can go.

19:43.015 --> 19:44.057
Got it.

19:45.142 --> 19:47.477
Sure, we defeated Upper Ranks.

19:47.561 --> 19:54.193
But nothing's gonna end
until we defeat Muzan Kibutsuji.

20:02.284 --> 20:03.535
I leave it to you.

20:04.536 --> 20:06.705
Okay. I'll definitely defeat him.

20:13.921 --> 20:17.090
Tanjiro, do your best at the next site.

20:18.759 --> 20:22.137
May we meet again
at the next training place, everyone!

20:23.722 --> 20:25.515
Kamado! We trust you!

20:25.599 --> 20:27.768
We'll catch up with you later!

20:29.978 --> 20:32.356
I'm going, and thank you.

20:32.856 --> 20:34.483
Yeah, stay well.

20:38.862 --> 20:40.280
Good luck!

20:40.364 --> 20:41.740
Take care!

20:41.823 --> 20:43.033
See you later!

20:55.671 --> 20:59.258
We've arrived! We've arrived!

21:00.926 --> 21:02.261
Work hard.

21:07.015 --> 21:08.433
I can't take it anymore.

21:10.352 --> 21:11.853
What are you saying?

21:11.937 --> 21:15.732
If you can't do this,
you'll get eaten by demons in no time.

21:17.442 --> 21:18.777
Tokito.

21:30.622 --> 21:35.002
If this was real combat,
you would have already died three times.

21:42.092 --> 21:46.388
The flame that burns heaven

21:46.471 --> 21:53.395
Truer than the truth

21:53.478 --> 21:57.482
The voice of prayers and
The sounds of shouting

21:57.566 --> 22:04.072
Are fleeting like winged insects

22:04.156 --> 22:08.744
Why do those who devour lives

22:08.827 --> 22:15.667
Beg mercy as if not knowing impurity

22:15.751 --> 22:21.840
Those souls that win through
The darkness can only reach

22:21.923 --> 22:26.636
Obtain that eternity

22:26.720 --> 22:32.392
There's a feeling here
That doesn't know demise

22:32.476 --> 22:37.564
Speak your dream, you strong one

22:37.647 --> 22:43.361
A resound congratulating tune of eternity

22:43.445 --> 22:49.076
Into the light that governs the sky

22:49.159 --> 22:53.330
In the corner of the world that is messy

22:53.413 --> 22:57.584
A blade of a sword
That still wriggles and resists

22:57.667 --> 23:03.632
Grovels and struggles miserably

23:06.051 --> 23:07.052
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA:
HASHIRA TRAINING ARC NO. 3

23:07.969 --> 23:10.097
This time I'll tell you about Uzui.

23:10.972 --> 23:13.058
I've already retired as a Hashira.

23:13.141 --> 23:15.602
If you're gonna introduce me,
do it flamboyantly.

23:15.685 --> 23:16.686
Okay!

23:16.770 --> 23:19.106
Let's start the Taisho period secret.

23:19.189 --> 23:21.483
His hobby is looking for
hidden hot springs.

23:21.566 --> 23:25.070
He healed his wounds there after
the battle at the Entertainment District.

23:25.153 --> 23:26.613
So plain.

23:27.322 --> 23:30.992
At least say something like,
"He soaked with his three lovely wives."

23:31.076 --> 23:33.328
I see. I learned something new.

23:33.411 --> 23:37.082
Because I love them
more than anyone in the world!

23:37.165 --> 23:39.084
Sir Tengen!

23:40.085 --> 23:42.045
What a wonderful family.

23:42.129 --> 23:44.840
Next up on Episode 4:
"It Makes You Smile."

23:44.923 --> 23:46.091
TO BE CONTINUED
